# Density Compare
# Bromine (Br) — real density 3.12 g/cm³. equal masses: Bromine vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Bromine Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 13.7mm color: #a62929 at (-20mm, 6.8mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 24.9 g — the water cube is the reference
